{"id":"n71610-1-10","stage":5,"title":"이기심 · 利己心","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71610-1-10-1","ko":"너 오빠랑 왜 싸운 거야?","zh":"你为什么和你哥哥吵架了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}},{"text":"오빠랑","meaning":"哥哥（女性对哥哥的称呼）","explanation":"오빠：哥哥（女性对哥哥的称呼）；랑：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"오빠","audio":"/audio/14e10e3b73bff8540288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68006","senseId":"1","lemma":"오빠","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오빠랑","audio":"/audio/429b022846768b1f1239.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么。","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"싸운","meaning":"打架，争斗","explanation":"싸우다：打架，争斗；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"싸우다","audio":"/audio/e27f0e273d4af17d7ed1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29732","senseId":"1","lemma":"싸우다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"싸운","audio":"/audio/9555c84b343dcb78c2da.mp3"}},{"text":"거야?","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거야","audio":"/audio/16592c1618a6826ee403.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"14e10e3b73bff854","term":"오빠","zh":"哥哥（女性对哥哥的称呼）","audio":"/audio/14e10e3b73bff8540288.mp3","entryId":"68006","definition":"女子用于指称或称呼兄弟姐妹或亲戚兄弟姐妹中比自己年长的男性。","pronunciation":["오빠"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"e27f0e273d4af17d","term":"싸우다","zh":"打架，争斗","audio":"/audio/e27f0e273d4af17d7ed1.mp3","entryId":"29732","definition":"想要获胜而用语言或力气等进行较量。","pronunciation":["싸우다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/fe03b2e7892c92e9ddc0.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n71610-1-10-2","ko":"서로 큰 방 쓰겠다고 이기심만 앞세우다가 다퉜어.","zh":"因为都想用大房间，只顾着自己的私心，所以吵起来了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"서로","meaning":"互相，相互","explanation":"서로：互相，相互。","readings":[{"term":"서로","audio":"/audio/fbeb53408bcf7039778f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66374","senseId":"1","lemma":"서로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"서로","audio":"/audio/fbeb53408bcf7039778f.mp3"}},{"text":"큰","meaning":"大，高，长，壮阔","explanation":"크다：大，高，长，壮阔；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"크다","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66586","senseId":"1","lemma":"크다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"큰","audio":"/audio/697674905873e8eb4c58.mp3"}},{"text":"방","meaning":"房间","explanation":"방：房间。","readings":[{"term":"방","audio":"/audio/76102fe82462d111be2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29724","senseId":"1","lemma":"방","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"방","audio":"/audio/76102fe82462d111be2a.mp3"}},{"text":"쓰겠다고","meaning":"用，使用","explanation":"쓰다：用，使用；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；다고：转述陈述句的内容：“说、听说……”。","readings":[{"term":"쓰다","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryI